From: Tim Douglas <me@timdoug.com>
Subject: [PATCH] librt: make its __dso_handle weak

librt defines a hidden __dso_handle of its own.  In a static link
crtbegin.o defines one too, and the two collided.  Make librt's weak.

Signed-off-by: Tim Douglas <me@timdoug.com>

diff --git a/librt/dso_handle.c b/librt/dso_handle.c
--- a/librt/dso_handle.c
+++ b/librt/dso_handle.c
@@ -2,4 +2,4 @@
  * Licensed under the LGPL v2.1 or later, see the file COPYING.LIB in this tarball.
  */
 
-const void *const __dso_handle attribute_hidden = &__dso_handle;
+const void *const __dso_handle attribute_hidden __attribute__((weak)) = &__dso_handle;
